# M1 package list: the cham3-full metapackage only. It depends on cham3-desktop
# (Plasma 6 Wayland session, KDE core utilities, cham3 panel) and on the curated
# Debian 13 suite. cham3-desktop and cham3-full are supplied from
# config/packages.chroot at build time: build_image.sh stages only the built
# packages named in ../../cham3-local-packages (this profile's manifest).
# cham3-base, the M0 skeleton, is neither staged nor listed: the M1 image does
# not need it.
cham3-full
